    "detailed_description": "Back To The Collis is a story-rich, fully hand-drawn Point &amp; Click adventure puzzle game, that will take you on a journey into the atmospheric world and amaze you with lots  of logical and engaging puzzles. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333220/extras/b756d95454ccc693d08012efd853c9a0.poster.avif?t=1747429089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333220/extras/b756d95454ccc693d08012efd853c9a0.webm?t=1747429089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333220/extras/b756d95454ccc693d08012efd853c9a0.mp4?t=1747429089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333220/extras/b26cfa8f3410f7d30f495994e9d73b7a.poster.avif?t=1747429089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333220/extras/b26cfa8f3410f7d30f495994e9d73b7a.webm?t=1747429089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333220/extras/b26cfa8f3410f7d30f495994e9d73b7a.mp4?t=1747429089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story</strong><br>In Back to the Collis you will play as Benjamin, who has formerly left the town of Collis, built on a hill, and now lives in the forest in his comfort, nearby the town.<br>But after a while, Benjamin must return to the Collis to tackle a seemingly simple problem of water shortage, which has already affected him as well.  <br>With Benjamin, you will have a chance to explore the town, introduce its varied  and memorable populace, their social problems, solve lots of exciting puzzles and who knows, maybe at the end of your shared journey you will even understand why he left this town long ago.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333220/extras/1147201a47905bbd12fccfe72e93d640.poster.avif?t=1747429089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333220/extras/1147201a47905bbd12fccfe72e93d640.webm?t=1747429089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333220/extras/1147201a47905bbd12fccfe72e93d640.mp4?t=1747429089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Design</strong><br>Back to the Collis is classic point &amp; click adventure game, where you will solve lots of engaging environmental quests and logical puzzles.<br>This game is designed to be more than just a game,  it is an adventure that  will make you think about the way of life of its society, their coexistence issues, which has lots of in common with our real ones. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333220/extras/ac247c5c8ca4a1c57683d7ffc5a23ce8.poster.avif?t=1747429089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333220/extras/ac247c5c8ca4a1c57683d7ffc5a23ce8.webm?t=1747429089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333220/extras/ac247c5c8ca4a1c57683d7ffc5a23ce8.mp4?t=1747429089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The backgrounds and characters in the game are fully hand-drawn, and every animation and sound has been carefully created especially for each engagement.<br><br></li><li> It's a deep storyline game without dialogues at all, you won\u2019t be disturbed by lengthy dialogs, as there is no spoken language in the game. Instead, all character interactions are conveyed through bubbles and animations.<br><br></li><li>To enhance the experience of the atmospheric game world, unique music is crafted for each scene.</li></ul>",
